Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.93,0:00:57.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hachikuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.06,0:01:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:04.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so damn cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.40,0:01:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me touch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:07.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me hug you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:09.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm gonna see your panties!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:16.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oww!\NThe hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:25.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not an enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:29.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calm down! Take a deep breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:37.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You breathe like a Terminator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.02,0:01:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me! Me! Take a good look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.82,0:01:48.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Muraragi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.61,0:01:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call people things that sound so unsatisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:53.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I stuttered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:54.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you did it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bit my tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.16,0:01:57.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wasn't on purpose?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.37,0:01:58.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,God is with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.91,0:02:00.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What miracle happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:08.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you've been studying for your exams?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.13,0:02:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I can get help from the valedictorian and the 7th-best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:19.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-san's the one with braids that I met, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:20.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.06,0:02:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Senjougahara-san's your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.57,0:02:35.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd go for Hanekawa-san between the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.66,0:02:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems kind of weird that you'd pick Senjougahara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.99,0:02:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:47.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think of Hanekawa like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:53.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I owe her too much, and she'd probably shoot me down anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.63,0:02:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus I'm into Senjougahara, despite her personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.02,0:03:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, if you say you prefer Senjougahara-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:12.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It takes all kinds.\NI guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.03,0:03:14.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's "everyone has a type", isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:16.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:19.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About that vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:22.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... She's going by Oshino Shinobu-san now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks about eight, blonde, with a helmet and goggles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.17,0:03:30.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to get close so I can't be sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.93,0:03:39.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I think I saw her around yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.85,0:03:45.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At around five at night,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.85,0:03:46.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,at the donut shop by the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.73,0:03:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Donuts, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:54.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would Oshino really let her go out alone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.32,0:03:57.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.49,0:04:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I should tell you, so I waited for you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.37,0:04:04.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so sooner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:06.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:09.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some pedo came up to me and started groping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:11.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so shocked that I forgot all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry I gave you the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:18.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I could help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, do you have the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.43,0:04:22.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.26,0:04:26.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Later, Hachikuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.52,0:04:29.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. I know we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.74,0:06:48.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:07:00.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you going, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.51,0:07:06.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Volunteering.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NVery well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.18,0:07:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:18.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take pity on you and answer roll call for you.{there's a sex pun here}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:24.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll say it in your voice, so it should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My voice actress is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:32.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voice actress?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this, an anime?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.95,0:07:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful, Hitagi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:40.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The woman I've always dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:43.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How was it? Pretty good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:44.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:47.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd been looking forward to it, but it doesn't even match what I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.72,0:07:50.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't even said anything like that yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:56.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Yet". So you plan on it in the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:01.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hanekawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:24.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to ride your bike in the park.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:30.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's parking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is no time to worry about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:37.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're skipping school, quit worrying about biking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:40.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're completely different problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.23,0:08:41.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:49.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to make you skip school, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:51.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you think I was angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to be sarcastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:58.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I planned it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:03.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't have any trouble being absent from today's classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what's going to happen to the preparations for the arts festival with the organizers gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm having Senjougahara-san take care of things after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:17.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.56,0:09:20.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She took yesterday off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:21.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it's only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:28.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These have to be her pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.65,0:09:32.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.11,0:09:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, Hanekawa-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:35.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:39.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me take your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:43.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're making me angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:48.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:51.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm done joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.01,0:09:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Hanekawa?\NThose headaches again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:10:01.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I'm feeling better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:08.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About Golden Week...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:13.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remembered something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.57,0:10:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:22.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm remembering something I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:23.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:28.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A cat.\NIt's a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remembered that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.05,0:10:37.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The cat we buried together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:39.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remembered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:48.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you didn't just call me out here because you remembered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:50.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:52.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An aberration, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:10:57.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.11,0:11:00.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I'd like you to show me how to get to Oshino-san's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you show me the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.33,0:11:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:09.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,... Of course. But can I ask you a couple questions first?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:11.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been leaning too hard on Oshino to fix aberrations for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.59,0:11:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I end up making it his problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.05,0:11:20.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to have a handle on it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:24.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine, go ahead and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.85,0:11:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said you've had lots of headaches lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.27,0:11:30.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When exactly did they start?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Around a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:38.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yesterday and the day before were both when I was with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.28,0:11:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I've had them pretty bad at the bookstore and in front of school too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:45.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You should have told me then!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:46.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:49.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to make you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.09,0:11:52.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh well, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, after Golden Week,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:57.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,has anything happened to you involving cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something involving cats?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.89,0:12:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even just a black cat crossing your path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:09.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On May 27th,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.73,0:12:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the radio show I listen to at night read a letter from someone named "Big Bear Cat".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's related?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, this is what it said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:28.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People in comics and anime seem to have it really easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.75,0:12:32.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but being a maid must be incredibly stressful work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:34.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't have any time to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:37.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard this at a mixer recently, and it's right on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:40.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to go into that much detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.05,0:12:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:45.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think there was something funny about that letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.56,0:12:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't quite put my finger on it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:50.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.31,0:12:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He heard that maids never have any spare time,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:55.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,from someone he met at a relaxed mixer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.78,0:12:59.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you even need to tell me about that letter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.28,0:13:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. I didn't quite get it the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.95,0:13:09.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, if you think hard about it, a "Big Bear Cat" isn't a cat, it's a panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:12.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:14.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:16.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anything?\NWell...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:20.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the same show, there was a guy named "the Posturing Waggler".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Lately, when I've played President with my friends,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.68,0:13:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"after someone deals, one of them keeps saying things."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:35.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Things like 'when I was in middle school, 4 was the highest card'."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:37.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's funny about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.57,0:13:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I asked whether there was anything else, I didn't mean any more hard-to-understand letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:48.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, about that letter, in President there's all sorts of weird rules
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,like "8s go out of turn" or "anyone who's no longer President becomes the Asshole".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.25,0:13:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The joke is that they pick the best rules for the hand they've drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:59.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see! I knew you'd get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.21,0:14:02.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You thanking me for this doesn't make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.09,0:14:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, about the pen name "the Posturing Waggler",
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:10.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Posturing" and "Waggler" are written with the same kanji, so it's a bad pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:15.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But not all the letters to the show are that hard to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:18.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone named "Walk toward the apple" wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:23.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Yesterday a friend and I went to a video rental place."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"We wanted to rent the DVDs of a certain serial drama,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:30.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"but someone else had volume 8 out,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"so we were only able to watch up to volume 7."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:39.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"My friend said 'volume 7 makes it seem like it ends in 8.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:42.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"'The person who has volume 8 out now must be chuckling.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.43,0:14:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"I think the person who rented volume 8 is playing Sevens."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's pretty funny, but quit talking about the radio!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.81,0:14:56.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway.\NNext question, Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:01.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you take off your hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.19,0:15:04.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:07.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not a question, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:08.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:14.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa-sama, let me take your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:15.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:16.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:17.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're making me angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.34,0:15:23.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to be angry, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.21,0:15:29.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I care more about my debt to you than our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:34.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, your debt to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:44.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't you just save yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:49.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oshino may say so,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I think you saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:54.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:57.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want to do something for you in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:16:01.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I do, even if you get angry or hate me, I can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:04.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take it, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's pretty saucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:07.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:12.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming from you, it's saucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:15.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's something a bully would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to hear it from a star pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.60,0:16:19.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:21.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.93,0:16:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you thanking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.72,0:16:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well... Okay, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:59.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels like Golden Week again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's that, we can deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:04.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.\NLet's go to Oshino's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:14.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're going to complain that doubling up on a bike is against the law?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:18.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I kind of want to, but I'll let it slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:22.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made you skip school, so it's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:25.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't calling that a fair trade kind of weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:30.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:34.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:40.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.98,0:17:43.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And big!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.27,0:17:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:49.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something we need to talk about after we get off the bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.62,0:18:01.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even still, it must be so much trouble for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:07.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to take care of so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.38,0:18:08.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So many people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like Senjougahara-san, and Mayoi-chan, and Kanbaru-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.47,0:18:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Sengoku-chan yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.84,0:18:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all girls, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.51,0:18:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And always with aberrations, now that I think of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:28.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems like you're not done yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:31.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.57,0:18:33.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way Senjougahara-san really recovered that quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:41.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It started when you were attacked by a vampire over spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's when it all began.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.75,0:18:48.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The aberrations themselves were always there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like they just showed up one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you know, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:56.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:18:59.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of the special powers of vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.81,0:19:04.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They captivate humans with their charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.14,0:19:04.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captivate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:07.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like hypnotism.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One gaze into those eyes can captivate someone for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:14.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing, just a thought I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:21.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it has something to do
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.49,0:19:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with why you're so popular with the girls all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm just teasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:33.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything, it helps me understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.34,0:19:38.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Charm, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.39,0:19:46.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:57.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.95,0:20:01.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And the class prez, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her hair's different, but with those glasses it's gotta be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Prez.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Araragi-kun, I saw you yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, can't you say "I've been waiting" or "I stayed up waiting"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:20.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing like that today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.97,0:20:23.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:28.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up, Prez?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:29.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have today off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:35.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really think he's trying to sabotage you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.78,0:20:39.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.11,0:20:42.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Must be the Foundation Day I've heard about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:45.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:47.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.25,0:20:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That cap looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:52.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.46,0:20:56.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's what you're up to, Araragi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:21:00.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really can't even take three steps without getting in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:09.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm really busy right now, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.19,0:21:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so busy I don't have any spare time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:16.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.86,0:21:23.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're you, but I've gotta be a bit accomodating if Prez comes to me with a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:26.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A meddlecat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.33,0:21:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has to be considered one of the three legendary cat spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.25,0:21:38.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're you, but I don't even need to tell this to Prez, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:45.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop it with the "You're you, but" when you mention Hanekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.85,0:21:47.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's starting to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.06,0:21:51.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.69,0:21:53.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't tell a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd better keep your eyes open at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.11,0:21:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm a night owl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.19,0:22:04.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cats are night owls, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.21,0:22:18.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hanekawa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.80,0:22:20.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get worked up, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quite nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:23.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a good thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.47,0:22:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting to see Prez's cat ears,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.05,0:22:29.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,getting to see her in her pajamas,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.68,0:22:32.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't judge me like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:33.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.60,0:22:36.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not a misunderstanding, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.77,0:22:41.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If anything, you should thank me for giving you an excuse to bike the whole way here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.24,0:22:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with Prez's arms wrapped around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:50.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've already scouted out the situation, haven't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.16,0:22:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened with the shy girl the day before yesterday must have woken you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:57.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Sengoku's a shy girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.83,0:23:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.75,0:23:05.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With what you've learned, I don't really have anything to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:07.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna skip a step here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.97,0:23:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Skip a step?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.47,0:23:11.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:17.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's quicker to ask her herself than bother Prez.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:20.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:21.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.48,0:23:22.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here she comes, Araragi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here comes the sex kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:42.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we meet again, human. I'm amazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.42,0:23:47.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it looks like you haven't been punished for lusting after my myaster's boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:50.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're always such a bad boy, meow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.01,0:23:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to be eaten up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.57,0:25:26.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Karen!\NI'm Tsukihi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.90,0:25:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, about baseball.\NAbout baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.32,0:25:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't question the ump, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.82,0:25:30.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.74,0:25:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ump's judgments are absolute!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.41,0:25:34.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you can try to fast-talk him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:35.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fast-talk him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.66,0:25:38.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey umpire, don't pretend with me, you had to have seen that was an out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.95,0:25:39.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.87,0:25:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cunning!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:42.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do it at the wrong time, you get ejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.29,0:25:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get outta here, you bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.17,0:25:44.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Preview quiz!\NQuiz!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.46,0:25:46.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Preview squeeze!\NSqueeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.04,0:25:47.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Squeeze means bunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.46,0:25:48.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.38,0:25:49.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's a safety squeze? I don't get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.97,0:25:51.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't get it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.13,0:25:52.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's safe about a sacrifice bunt?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.55,0:25:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's sacrificial! That's a paradox, make up your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.84,0:25:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being so vague makes it confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.14,0:25:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with a bunt that makes you safe by sacrificing you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.47,0:26:00.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a quiz, that was just a complaint!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.43,0:26:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next time, Tsubasa Cat part 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.35,0:26:03.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bunt to advance the runner!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.69,0:26:05.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A failed bunt.
